# Equity Position Playbook: Cach nhung tay loi doi thuc su lam

**Hunt ID:** HUNT-260524-equity-position-operator
**Mode:** Flow (equity money flow tracing)
**Query:** "Lam sao tim cong ty khoi dau/kho khan, co co phan, thu nhap thu dong?"

---

## CANH BAO TRUOC

90% startup that bai. Bat ky co phan nao trong startup = 90% xac suat = 0 dong. [K, CB Insights, Carta 2024]

Nhung tay loi doi BIET dieu nay. Ho khong "dau tu" — ho **TAO VI TRI** trong dong tien. Equity chi la PHAN THUONG cho vi tri, khong phai muc tieu.

---

## 7 CO CHE THUC SU (Xep theo do "loi doi")

### CO CHE 1: SWEAT EQUITY — "Doi code lay co phan" (Co ban nhat)

**Cau truc chinh xac:**
- Idea-stage, dong gop ngang nhau: 30-50% equity [K, Carta 2024 — 73% startup 2 nguoi chia 50/50]
- Post-idea, CTO-level: 15-30%
- Post-MVP, co traction: 5-15%
- Vest 4 nam, cliff 1 nam. Double-trigger acceleration: neu bi mua lai truoc khi vest het → vest 100% ngay

**Noi tim:**
- Wellfound (AngelList): filter "equity only" + "co-founder"
- CoFoundersLab, YC co-founder matching
- VN: facebook.com/groups/cto.founder, facebook.com/groups/cto.platform (1,800+ posts), voz.vn co-founder threads
- TopDev Founder Matching events
- Antler Vietnam: $120K cho 12% post-match [K]

**DO LOI DOI: 3/10.** Ai cung biet cach nay. Khong co asymmetry. Ban doi thoi gian lay lottery ticket.

---

### CO CHE 2: ADVISOR EQUITY — "Ban chuyen mon, nhan co phan nho, dau tu 5h/thang"

**Cau truc chinh xac (FAST Agreement — fi.co/fast, mien phi):**

| Muc do tham gia | Idea Stage | Startup Stage | Growth Stage |
|---|---|---|---|
| Standard (call hang thang) | 0.25% | 0.20% | 0.15% |
| Expert (intros + projects) | 1.00% | 0.80% | 0.60% |

- Vest 2 nam, cliff 3 thang
- Khong can luat su — template 1 trang tai fi.co/fast

**Cach choi cua tay loi doi:** Khong advise 1 startup. Advise 10-15 startup cung luc. Moi cai 0.25-1%. 5h/thang/cai. Neu 1/10 thanh cong (base rate hop ly) → 1 equity co gia tri. **Portfolio approach — giong VC nhung bang thoi gian.**

**DO LOI DOI: 5/10.** Diversification strategy dung. Nhung van la lottery — chi khac la ban mua nhieu ve hon.

---

### CO CHE 3: EQUITY FOR SERVICES — "Lam dich vu, lay co phan thay tien"

**Cau truc (EASE Agreement — fi.co/ease):**
- Tinh: gia tri dich vu theo gia thi truong / valuation cong ty = % equity
- VD: $30K dev work / $300K valuation = 10%
- Hoac: (luong bo / valuation) x risk factor (1.5-3x) = equity %
- Vest theo milestone, hoac cliff khi hoan thanh

**Noi tim:**
- Upwork/Toptal founders post "need dev, no budget" → offer equity deal
- Product Hunt launches khong co CTO
- Indie Hackers "Partner Up" section

**DO LOI DOI: 4/10.** Van la doi skill lay lottery ticket. Nhung it nhat co cau truc phap ly ro rang hon co-founder.

