### CO CHE 4: SELF-FUNDED SEARCH (ETA) — "Tim cong ty co loi nhuan, mua bang tien nguoi khac"

**Day la co che cua THUC SU LOI DOI:**

**Cau truc chinh xac [K, Searchfunder.com + SearchFund.org]:**
- Operator tim deal, ky LOI, van hanh cong ty
- Investor bo 100% von
- Chia: Investor 50% (preferred return 8-14%) + Operator 50% (common stock)
- Tiered carry: 30% duoi 15% IRR, 40% duoi 20% IRR, 60% tren 20% IRR
- SBA loan (chi My): 10% down, 10 nam, chinh phu bao lanh

**Target:** Cong ty $500K-$2.5M EBITDA, dich vu, manufacturing nhe, software. Chu muon nghi huu/chan.

**Von can:** $0 neu seller carry 100%. Thuc te: $10-50K legal + due diligence.

**HAN CHE LON:** SBA chi cho nguoi My. Operator VN can partner voi US-based searcher hoac target cong ty VN.

**DO LOI DOI: 8/10.** Day la co che that. Ban khong dau tu TIEN — ban dau tu KHA NANG TIM VA VAN HANH. $0 capital → 50% equity trong cong ty co loi nhuan.

