### CO CHE 5: DISTRESSED ACQUISITION — "Mua cong ty sap chet"

**Co che:**
- Startup het tien, team con nguyen → acqui-hire (mua team + IP)
- Hoac: CEO role + 10-25% equity grant + luong thap, earn-in theo milestone

**Noi tim startup sap chet:**
- Crunchbase: filter "last funding >18 months, seed stage, no Series A"
- Twitter/X: founders noi "running out of runway"
- VN: CafeF.vn + VnEconomy.vn — search "giai the" + "startup"
- DPI registry: dangkykinhdoanh.gov.vn — dissolution records
- **sanmuabandoanhnghiep.net** — san mua ban doanh nghiep VN. Listings tu 0 dong den 50 ty. [K]
- **mva.vn** — MVA Group advisory + marketplace M&A

**VN data: startup sap chet cu the:**
- Telio ($65M raised → dissolved 12/2024, 400+ nhan vien)
- LuxStay ($15.5M raised → dissolved 2022)
- WeFit ($1M raised → pha san 2020)
- Shark Tank VN: We Escape (30B → giai the), WeFit → pha san

**Thoi diem tot nhat:** Thang 6-9 cua crisis (het tien nhung chua chinh thuc giai the). Truc tiep lien lac founder.

**Von toi thieu VN:**
- Shell company (sach thue, 0 tai san): 0-50M VND ($0-2,000)
- Acqui-hire team 3-5 nguoi: 200-500M VND ($8-20K)

**DO LOI DOI: 7/10.** Gap gio luc thi truong VN startup investment giam 38% (2024: $196M → $120M). Founders tuyet vong hon → equity re hon. [K, Vietstock 2025]

