### CO CHE 6: MICRO PE ROLLUP — "Mua 1, gom nhieu, ban cao"

**Co che cua tay thuc su loi doi (Tiny.com model):**
- Mua 1 cong ty nho (platform) bang seller financing
- Gom them doi thu nho bang stock swap (tra co phan thay tien)
- Logic: mua o 3-4x EBITDA, ban o 6-10x EBITDA sau khi gom

**VN relevant industries:** F&B chains, beauty salon, logistics, education center — fragmented, nhieu chu nho

**Von:** $0 neu seller carry 100%. Thuc te: 200-500M VND ($8-20K)

**DO LOI DOI: 9/10.** Day la co che cua nhung Andrew Wilkinson, Brent Beshore. Khong xay gi moi. Tim cai da co loi nhuan. Mua re. Gom lai. Ban dat.

