### CO CHE 7: REVENUE SHARE → EQUITY CONVERSION — "Chung minh truoc, lay equity sau"

**Co che:**
- Buoc 1: Thoa thuan X% revenue trong Y thang doi lay dich vu (khong equity)
- Buoc 2: Sau 6-12 thang chung minh gia tri → convert revenue share thanh equity
- Cap: 1.5-2.5x invested value roi convert

**DO LOI DOI: 6/10.** An toan hon vi ban duoc tra truoc. Nhung cham — can 6-12 thang truoc khi co equity.

