## NGUOI LOI DOI THUC SU LAM GI MA NGUOI THUONG KHONG THAY

### 1. HO KHONG "DAU TU" — HO **TAO VI TRI**

Nguoi thuong: "Tim startup tot → bo tien vao → hy vong len gia"
Tay loi doi: "Tim DONG TIEN dang chay → tim NODE BOTTLENECK → ngoi vao do → equity la phan thuong cho vi tri, khong phai muc tieu"

VD cu the: Khong mua co phan startup F&B. Thay vao do, lam CHUOI CUNG CAP cho 20 startup F&B. Khi ho can nguyen lieu → ban cung cap → lay % equity nho (0.5-2%) tu moi cong ty thay vi chiet khau. 20 cong ty x 1% = portfolio.

### 2. HO DUNG "SELLER FINANCING" — KHONG BAO GIO TRA TRUOC

Nguoi thuong: "Toi can tien de mua cong ty"
Tay loi doi: "Chu cong ty tra tien cho chinh toi de toi mua cong ty cua ho"

Co che: Seller carry 70-100% gia tri. Tra dan tu cash flow cua chinh cong ty do. $0 down.

Khi nao seller dong y? Khi ho TUYET VONG: sap nghi huu, benh, ly hon, chan. Tim nhung nguoi nay.

### 3. HO DIVERSIFY BANG THOI GIAN, KHONG BANG TIEN

Nguoi thuong: "Bo $10K vao 1 startup"
Tay loi doi: "Advise 15 startup, moi cai 5h/thang, lay 0.5-1% equity. Cost = 75h/thang. 1/15 thanh cong = win."

### 4. HO TIM "BRIDGE DEALS" — KHONG PHAI "LONG-TERM INVESTMENT"

Khong nam giu co phan 5-10 nam. Tim cong ty DANG CAN bridge financing → cho muon/dich vu → lay equity → exit trong 12-24 thang khi ho raise round tiep.

### 5. HO DUNG THONG TIN BAT DOI XUNG

Biet TRUOC khi thi truong biet:
- Cong ty nao sap het tien (qua nguoi quen trong team)
- Nganh nao dang co regulation moi (co hoi compliance)
- Startup nao dang bi founder conflict (co hoi mua re)

**Day la ly do NETWORK > CAPITAL.** Thong tin den truoc tien bao gio cung thang.

