## DIEU VN-SPECIFIC CAN BIET

### Luat VN giet vesting kieu My

- Enterprise Law 2020: moi von gop phai dong trong **90 ngay** tu khi cap ERC [K, Baker McKenzie VN]
- Khong co cliff/vest native trong luat VN
- Workaround: dieu khoan charter + han che chuyen nhuong + quyen mua lai. Can luat su (~15-20M VND / $600-800)
- **LLC (TNHH)**: chuyen nhuong can 75% thanh vien dong y — co-founder bi ket
- **JSC (Co phan)**: tu do chuyen nhuong sau 3 nam — tot hon cho equity deals

### Thi truong hien tai = buyer's market

- VN startup investment giam 38% (2024) [K, Vietstock]
- Founders tuyet vong hon → equity re hon
- Window: 2025-2026 la thoi diem tot de mua equity re
- Nhieu startup seed/pre-seed da raise 18+ thang truoc ma khong co Series A → target

